   This File contains the ALADDIN entries for the reactions covered
  in "Cross sections for Collision processes of Hydrogen Atoms with 
  Electrons, Protons and Multiply Charged Ions", in Atomic and Plasma-
  Material Interaction Data for Fusion, a Supplement to the journal
  Nuclear Fusion, Vol. 4, 1993. 
     Evaluation functions have been created for all the analytic
  formulae used to define cross sections and reaction rates. For the
  reactions which are dependent on specific state specifications,
  seperate entries may need to be created. The state specfication, for
  some classes of reactions can be passed to the particular
  evaluation function in the interactive mode. The coefficient data
  required for any evaluation function should be studied before
  generating data.

